{"name": "Blood & Chaos", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood &amp; Chaos</strong> is a party based roguelike RPG that puts you in command of a fellowship of adventurers. Build a team of up to six heroes and lead them through a perilous, ever changing world where every decision carries weight and every loss is permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore cities, uncover quests, and descend into deadly dungeons as the past begins to resurface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your fellowship rise to legend, or be consumed by chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/609117c86ed3313137948152d445dd0e.poster.avif?t=1780587406\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/609117c86ed3313137948152d445dd0e.webm?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tactical turn based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in challenging battles where every move counts. Position your heroes wisely, exploit enemy weaknesses, and unleash powerful spells and abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.poster.avif?t=1780587406\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.webm?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.mp4?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dangerous exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into cursed dungeons filled with traps, secrets, and unpredictable threats. Each descent is different, shaped by chance and choice. The deeper you go, the higher the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/607b1de8d7c59ea47286755cdd8189a9.poster.avif?t=1780587406\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/607b1de8d7c59ea47286755cdd8189a9.webm?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/607b1de8d7c59ea47286755cdd8189a9.mp4?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and develop a party of up to six unique heroes, each with distinct skills and roles. Shape their progression, manage equipment, and adapt your strategy as challenges grow harsher. Losses are permanent, and every fallen hero matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/959f501ecd89ce4da7c043da480cb049.avif?t=1780587406\" width=\"609\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A living world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the dungeons lie cities and other places of refuge. Interact with NPCs, uncover hidden quests, and navigate a world shaped by ancient conflicts, divine influence, and your own actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/d27cd27bc1d071bec9921aa5fcee03e1.poster.avif?t=1780587406\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/d27cd27bc1d071bec9921aa5fcee03e1.webm?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/d27cd27bc1d071bec9921aa5fcee03e1.mp4?t=1780587406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"13\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/04a19d9979b59ade6bb8187fe653db58.webp?t=1780587406\" width=\"101\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A classic soul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tribute to the golden era of \u201980s RPGs, <strong>Blood &amp; Chaos</strong> blends classic depth and atmosphere with modern roguelike mechanics and quality of life improvements. Every run tells a different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Ancient sacrifices saved the world, but their legacy is unraveling. A party based roguelike inspired by classic '80s RPGs, where every descent into cursed dungeons carries permanent consequences.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/0176c127770befbf6f50dc82674827cde5f0c3dc/header.jpg?t=1780587406", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Traditional Roguelike", "CRPG", "Dungeon Crawler", "Perma Death", "Difficult", "Turn-Based"], "developers": "Guau Games", "publishers": "Guau Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2628880", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/9EzpciiKCGg", "first_seen": 1782597600.0, "review_rank": 375}